 "title": "Separable contraction of an irreducible polynomial in positive characteristic",
 "statement": "Let $F$ be a field [def-weil-field] of characteristic a prime $p>0$, and let $f\\in F[Z]$ [def-weil-polynomial-ring] be irreducible, meaning that $f$ is nonzero, is not a unit, and every factorization of $f$ has a unit factor. There exist an integer $m\\ge0$ and a separable polynomial $g\\in F[Z]$ [def-pc-separable-polynomial] such that $f(Z)=g(Z^{p^m})$.",
